# Required for the Booking Request form to actually email the hotel.
# Sign up free at https://resend.com, verify a sending domain (or use
# their onboarding domain for testing), and paste the API key below.
RESEND_API_KEY=

# Where booking requests are sent. Defaults to mirage.co.uk@gmail.com
# (set in lib/site-config.ts) if left blank.
BOOKING_TO_EMAIL=mirage.co.uk@gmail.com

# The "from" address Resend sends as. Must be on a domain you've
# verified with Resend — resend.dev works for testing only.
BOOKING_FROM_EMAIL=Mirage Hotel Website <bookings@resend.dev>
